  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot. Slice cucumber into thin sticks.\n• Cut firm tofu (see ingredients) into 1cm pieces.\n• Place cornflour (see ingredients) in a medium bowl. Season with salt and pepper. Add tofu and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631198f65c8422947f0627f8/step-6d6f0265.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, shake excess flour off the tofu, then cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat. Add plant-based Asian mushroom sauce and lemongrass & makrut lime paste, tossing to thicken, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631198f65c8422947f0627f8/step-87648dec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, combine grated carrot, slaw mix, mayonnaise and a drizzle of rice wine vinegar in a large bowl. Season to taste.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631198f65c8422947f0627f8/step-d0b78996.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fill each tortilla with a helping of slaw, cucumber and lemongrass and makrut lime tofu.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631198f65c8422947f0627f8/step-4ee7a10b.jpg"
    }
  ]
